# Every change needs a review from the engineering team before it can merge.
#
# The team must keep write access to this repository: GitHub silently ignores a
# CODEOWNERS entry whose team cannot push, requesting no review at all rather
# than reporting an error.
* @YottaBot-Platform/engineering

# Release and supply-chain surfaces. Called out separately so a change here is
# visible as such in review, not buried in a diff.
/.github/workflows/ @YottaBot-Platform/engineering
/.goreleaser.yml    @YottaBot-Platform/engineering
/go.mod             @YottaBot-Platform/engineering
/go.sum             @YottaBot-Platform/engineering
